---
source: crates/navree-orm/tests/sql/main.rs
expression: "rows(table(\"documents\").select_expr(Expr::vector_distance_by(Expr::col(\"embedding\"),\n&embedding, navree_orm::VectorMetric::Euclidean), \"l2\"))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "embedding" <-> CAST($1 AS vector) AS "l2" FROM "documents"
  values: [String("[0.25,-1.5,3]")]
MySQL: SELECT VEC_DISTANCE_EUCLIDEAN(`embedding`, VEC_FromText(?)) AS `l2` FROM `documents`
  values: [String("[0.25,-1.5,3]")]
SQLite: error: a vector distance is not supported on SQLite
